@host = http://localhost:5000
@studentCode = DTC245200604

### 1. Kiem tra API - 200
GET {{host}}/

### 2. Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{host}}/api/assignments

### 3. Tao luot nop - 201 + Location + received
# Doi studentCode hoac khoi dong lai API truoc khi chay lai ca nay.
# @name createSubmission
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "{{studentCode}}",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/{{studentCode}}/signalr"
}

### 4. Doc luot nop vua tao - 200 (received -> processing -> graded)
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 5. Thieu du lieu - 400 INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Bai tap 99 khong ton tai - 404 ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{host}}/api/assignments/99/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "{{studentCode}}",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/{{studentCode}}/signalr"
}

### 7. GUID rong - 404 SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND
GET {{host}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 8. Bat tay SignalR - 200 + connectionId
POST {{host}}/hubs/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1

### 9. Sai duong dan hub - 404
POST {{host}}/hub/submissions/negotiate?negotiateVersion=1
